NautiK9 follows the design and intent of Jade Vault (MIT licence, v2.16.1):
owner/other separation, bearer-token API on a trusted LAN, any OpenAI-compatible provider with a
configurable fallback chain, honest model errors, markdown notes with [[links]], backlinks and #tags.
NautiK9 is a Rust rewrite; no Jade Vault source code is copied.
